 to show POI and road labels along a route."}],"title":"POI Along a Route","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/poialongrouteexample","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/POIAlongRouteExample"},"https://opensource.foursquare.com/os-places/":{"type":"link","title":"Foursquare OS Places","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Foursquare OS Places","type":"text"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/opensource.foursquare.com\/os-places\/","url":"https:\/\/opensource.foursquare.com\/os-places\/"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"type":"topic","title":"MapLibre","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/LineStyleLayerExample":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adding an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNLineStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" to the map using a GeoJSON file."}],"title":"Using GeoJSON with a line style layer","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/linestylelayerexample","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/LineStyleLayerExample"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/GeoJSON":{"type":"topic","abstract":[],"title":"Working with GeoJSON Data","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/AnimatedLineExample":{"kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.sw